        <h1>Biography</h1>
        <p>Priyanshu Kumar Mishra is a third-year B.Tech student pursuing Computer Science and Engineering at B.M. Institute of Engineering and Technology (BMIET), Sonipat, Haryana, affiliated with Guru Gobind Singh Indraprastha University (GGSIPU). Hailing from Delhi, he completed his 10th and 12th grades at Kendriya Vidyalaya, R.K. Puram, New Delhi. Passionate about technology, Priyanshu aspires to become a professional web and game developer. In his free time, he enjoys playing cricket and football, as well as watching anime and reading manga.</p>
